[component]
name: Remove Item from List
category: Lists & Dictionaries
description: Remove an item from a list by value or by position.

[interaction]
title Remove Item
text! lst | List | items
list by | Remove by | Value | Value, Position
text! value | Value / Position | x

[template]
<PWCT:NEWSTEP> Remove <value> from <lst> (by <by>)
<PWCT:IF> <by> == Value
<lst>.remove(<value>)
<PWCT:ELSE>
del <lst>[<value>]
<PWCT:ENDIF>
